WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.333
<v Sunniva Oduya>Thank you sort of, for calling Meadow, this call may be recorded.

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:09.533
<v Greer Oduya>Hi, yeah, I need to reset my Meadow card PIN.

00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:13.200
<v Sunniva Oduya>I can help. Can I get your full name?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.200
<v Greer Oduya>Greer Oduya.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.733
<v Sunniva Oduya>And for verification, your social security number?

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:24.267
<v Greer Oduya>It's nine six four three nine three zero five six.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:27.400
<v Sunniva Oduya>Sorry, could you repeat that?

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.400
<v Greer Oduya>964-39-3056.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.867
<v Sunniva Oduya>Thank you. And your date of birth?

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:35.133
<v Greer Oduya>27th of January.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:39.667
<v Sunniva Oduya>Okay. The new card goes to the address in Lowmoor?

00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:51.000
<v Greer Oduya>Yes. Oh and basically, my number changed, it's seven seven eight five five five oh one oh... I mean, seven seven eight five five five zero one four six.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.667
<v Sunniva Oduya>Got it. Anything else?

00:00:53.867 --> 00:01:00.667
<v Greer Oduya>No, wait, yes, I walked past a meadow on the way here and remembered the branch closed.

00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:06.933
<v Sunniva Oduya>Right, that branch basically, closed basically, last month. Have a nice day.
